{"code":"kin","quarters":[{"id":"2026-01","title":"Kunga Ubumwe kw'Ijuru N'Isi: Kristo mu Bafilipi n'Abakolosayi","description":"Tekereza ku murimo utoroshye kurusha iyindi yose wigeze ukora. Ni iki cyatumaga uwo murimo utoroha? Ese byaterwaga n'ibyo abantu babaga biteze kuri uwo murimo, cyangwa igihe uwo murimo wari kumara, cyangwa byombi? Ese yaba ari imyifatire yawe kur'icyo gikorwa? Cyangwa se wenda ni abantu mwakoranaga? Cyangwa se birashoboka ko byasaga n'aho bidashoboka ko umuntu yagira icyo ageraho?","human_date":"Mutarama • Gashhyantare • Werurwe 2025","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2026","color_primary":"#2E4161","color_primary_dark":"#1E2C44","splash":true,"credits":[{"name":"Umwanditsi W'iki kigisho","value":"Clinton Wahlen"},{"name":"Unoza Inyandiko Mukuru","value":"Clifford R. Goldstein"},{"name":"Unoza Inyandiko Wungirije","value":"Soraya Scheidweiler"},{"name":"Ushinzwe Imirimo yo Gusohora Inyandiko","value":"Lea Alexander Greve"},{"name":"Ushinzwe Ubwanditsi Wungirije","value":"Sharon Thomas-Crews"},{"name":"Umuhuzabikorwa w'Icapiro \"Pacific Press\"","value":"Miguel Valdivia"},{"name":"Ushinzwe Ubugeni no Gutunganya Igitabo","value":"Lars Justinen"}],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Baratotejwe Ariko Ntibaretswe","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Impamvu Zo Gushima No Gusenga","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Kubaho No Gupfa","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Kunga Ubumwe Binyuze Mu Kwicisha Bugufi","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Kumurika Nk'Amatara Ya Nijoro","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Icyizere Muri Kristo Gusa","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Ubwenegihugu bw'Ijuru","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Isumbwe Rya Kristo","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Ubwiyunge n'Ibyiringiro","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Kuzurira Muri Kristo","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Kubana Na Kristo","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Kubana n'Abandi","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Guhagarara mu Bushake Bwose bw'Imana","start_date":"21/03/2026","end_date":"27/03/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-04","title":"Impano y'Ubuhanuzi","description":"Abahanga mu by'imikorere y'ubwonko batangiye gusobanukirwa ubushobozi butangaje abana b'impinja baba bafite bwo kumenya ururimi. Iyo umwana agejeje ku mezi atandatu, aba ashobora kumva amajwi agize amagambo y'icyongereza cyangwa andi magambo yo mu zindi ndimi zirenga 7.000 zivugwa. Iyo bahuye n'ururimi rutari urwa kavukire, na rwo bashobora kurwumva. Muri icyo gihe, urugi rw'amayobera rwo mu bwenge bw'umwana rurafunguka, bigatuma ashobora gutandukanya amajwi agera kuri 40 y'ururimi kavukire n'amajwi agera kuri 800 ashobora kumva akimara kuvuka. Ariko kandi hari ikintu kimwe bisaba abana b'impinja bagomba kuganirizwa. Ushobora kubyita amasomo y'ijwi ahabwa abana bavutse vuba.","human_date":"Ukwakira • Ugushyingo • Ukuboza 2026","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026","color_primary":"#54292F","color_primary_dark":"#3E1E22","splash":true,"credits":[{"name":"Umwanditsi W'iki kigisho","value":"The Ellen G. White Estate"},{"name":"Unoza Inyandiko Mukuru","value":"Clifford R. Goldstein"},{"name":"Unoza Inyandiko Wungirije","value":"Soraya Scheidweiler"},{"name":"Ushinzwe Imirimo yo Gusohora Inyandiko","value":"Lea Alexander Greve"},{"name":"Ushinzwe Ubwanditsi Wungirije","value":"Sharon Thomas-Crews"}],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Umuremyi Aravuga","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"02/10/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Umuhamagaro w'Umuhanuzi","start_date":"03/10/2026","end_date":"09/10/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"A